      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://wiki.x.org/wiki/radeonhd&#34;&gt;RadeonHD&lt;/a&gt; is the project around the driver for the ATI Radeon R5xx/RS6xx/R6xx video chipsets funded and supported by AMD. This driver is developed by a group of open source developers involving some engineers from SUSE. Since its inception 6 month ago this project has grown rapidly and has acquired a large user community.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will illustrate some of the &lt;a href=&#34;http://wiki.x.org/wiki/radeonhd&#34;&gt;RadeonHD&lt;/a&gt; projects history, it&amp;#39;s current status, its roadmap and future developments.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
